    "rationale": "The highest present path is untrusted customer ticket content reaching a restricted service-role database read and then a customer-visible write, which is a TC1 lethal trifecta with confused deputy characteristics. The only declared preventive control is a high-volume raw-action approval gate, which earns one tier of residual credit and is vulnerable to approval fatigue under autonomy increase or model upgrade. A separate present property finding remains high because the MCP server is installed from @latest with no pinning or verified identity, and approval prompts earn no credit against ASI04 supply-chain risk. Manual validation was applied because scripts could not be run."
